## Metrics & Success Criteria (By Release)

| Metric | 0.2.0 | 0.3.0-beta | 0.4.0 | 0.5.0 | Notes |
|--------|-------|-----------|-------|-------|-------|
| **Verdict applier coverage** | 2/5 (allow, block) | 2/5 | 3/5 (+ constrain) | 5/5 (+ approval, halt) | Deferred phases |
