---

## Success Definition (0.5.0 Stable)

- [x] Drop-in adoption: ≤4 lines adopter code (as of 0.2.0)
- [x] Zero-blocking default: Telemetry-default policy (as of 0.2.0)
- [ ] 5 verdicts routable (all phases wired)
